# Monthly Budget vs Actual Analysis

## 📝 Project Overview

This Excel-based dashboard compares budgeted vs actual financial performance across key expense categories for a fictional organization. It highlights monthly and year-to-date variances and provides dynamic charts to aid decision-making.

## 🔧 Tools & Skills Used
- Microsoft Excel (PivotTables, conditional formatting, charts)
- Budget variance analysis
- Dynamic dashboard design

## 📈 Key Features
- Monthly breakdown of actual vs budgeted spend
- Automatic variance calculations (favorable/unfavorable)
- Visual indicators and bar charts for performance tracking
- Slicer to filter by department/cost category

## 💡 Business Insight

This dashboard helps finance teams and department heads quickly identify overspending or savings opportunities, enabling better budget control and resource allocation.
